# rMLX local config. Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and edit for your machine:
#
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# The Makefile auto-loads `.env` (`-include .env`); dev/bench scripts load it via
# `scripts/lib/env.sh`. The binary itself reads none of these at startup — model
# paths are CLI arguments. These are dev / test conveniences only.
#
# Vars marked "(flag wins)" have a matching --flag; the env var is a persistent
# alternative but the CLI flag always takes precedence when both are set.

# ─── Required for make serve, bench scripts, and the test harness ─────────────
# The single directory that holds your downloaded model snapshots. Dedicated
# model paths are built off it, e.g.
#   $RMLX_O_MODELS_ROOT/mlx-community__gemma-4-e4b-it-mxfp8
#   $RMLX_O_MODELS_ROOT/mlx-community__Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-8bit
#   $RMLX_O_MODELS_ROOT/prism-ml__Ternary-Bonsai-8B-mlx-2bit
RMLX_O_MODELS_ROOT=/absolute/path/to/your/models

# ─── Build-time: MLX / mlx-c library location ─────────────────────────────────
# Where the MLX / mlx-c libraries live, if not on the default homebrew cellar
# path. Must contain lib/libmlxc.dylib and include/. Usually:
#   $(brew --prefix mlx)
# MLX_C_PREFIX=/opt/homebrew/opt/mlx

# ─── Runtime data root ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Where rMLX writes logs, metrics DB, cache, and tmp state.
# Default: <workspace>/.rmlx  (auto-detected from Cargo.lock), then $HOME/.rmlx
# RMLX_HOME=/absolute/path/to/.rmlx

# Override the metrics DB path (used by `rmlx metrics` subcommands).
# Default: $RMLX_HOME/metrics/runs.db
# RMLX_METRICS_DB=/absolute/path/to/runs.db

# ─── make serve / make chat defaults ─────────────────────────────────────────
# PORT=8080
# MODEL=${RMLX_O_MODELS_ROOT}/mlx-community__gemma-4-e4b-it-mxfp8

# ─── Log rotation cap ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Total log directory size cap in MB. Oldest .jsonl files are pruned at startup.
# (flag wins: --log-cap-mb)
# RMLX_LOG_CAP_MB=100

# ─── Prefill chunk tuning ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Tokens per prefill forward pass. Per-arch form also accepted:
#   RMLX_PREFILL_CHUNK_QWEN3_5_MOE=256
# Leave unset to use per-arch defaults.
# RMLX_PREFILL_CHUNK=256

# ─── YARN / long-context RoPE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Synthesise a YARN RoPE config for Qwen3-family models that ship without
# rope_scaling in config.json. Set RMLX_YARN_FACTOR > 1.0 to enable.
# Models that already declare rope_type == "yarn" (e.g. Bonsai) ignore these.
# (flag wins: --yarn-factor, --yarn-original-max)
# RMLX_YARN_FACTOR=4.0
# RMLX_YARN_ORIGINAL_MAX=32768

# ─── Session cache ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Maximum prompt-cache sessions held resident (default 8).
# (flag wins: --session-cache-max-sessions)
# RMLX_SESSION_CACHE_MAX_SESSIONS=8

# ─── Multimodal cache ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Byte budget for the vision/audio encoder-output cache (default 512 MiB).
# 0 disables. (flag wins: --mm-cache-bytes)
# RMLX_MM_CACHE_BYTES=536870912

# ─── Audio model paths ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Required only if you use /v1/audio/* endpoints. (flag wins for all four)
# RMLX_WHISPER_MODEL_PATH=${RMLX_O_MODELS_ROOT}/mlx-community__whisper-large-v3-mlx
# RMLX_WHISPER_TOKENIZER_PATH=/absolute/path/to/openai__whisper-large-v3
# RMLX_TTS_MODEL_PATH=${RMLX_O_MODELS_ROOT}/mlx-community__Qwen3-TTS
# RMLX_TTS_TOKENIZER_PATH=/absolute/path/to/Qwen3-TTS-tokenizer

# ─── Prompts directory ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Directory containing prompt JSON files used by `rmlx baseline` and bench
# scripts. Default: <repo>/prompts/  (flag wins: --prompts-dir)
# RMLX_PROMPTS_DIR=/absolute/path/to/prompts

# ─── Speculative decoding compat ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Legacy compat keys accepted by --draft-kind / --draft-block-size.
# Prefer the flags. (flag wins for both)
# MLX_VLM_DRAFT_KIND=mtp
# MLX_VLM_DRAFT_BLOCK_SIZE=4

# ─── Test harness: per-family snapshot overrides ─────────────────────────────
# Absolute paths (or basenames under RMLX_O_MODELS_ROOT) for model-gated
# integration tests. See docs/TESTING.md for the full list.
# RMLX_TEST_MODEL_GEMMA4_E4B=mlx-community__gemma-4-e4b-it-mxfp8
# RMLX_TEST_MODEL_QWEN36=mlx-community__Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-8bit
# RMLX_TEST_MODEL_BONSAI=prism-ml__Ternary-Bonsai-8B-mlx-2bit
